    85	Speed is not progress: code written before the thinking costs rounds of review. A design holds these tables before code
   235	  uses and fixed with Alex before the first arm. A standard or reference you write gives every sentence its source (the
   236	  signed standard, a decision, a PRD) or lists it for Alex's decision with a lean; settling wording is no licence to
